{"action": "finish", "reason": "The IDF formula in cell 6dd8e881 used `docCount - 1` instead of the standard smoothed IDF formula `docCount + 1`. This caused all TF-IDF vector scores to be slightly lower, which in turn reduced the pairwise cosine similarities (max 0.387 instead of 0.398, average 0.101 instead of 0.107). Changing `(docCount - 1)` to `(docCount + 1)` restores the correct IDF values and produces the expected final output."}
